  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 1,500eb (Very Expensive)</p>\n<p><em>When the carrying strength of your new synth-muscle is being limited by your bone density, replace their core with a stronger material. A favorite of the Animals, Europeans, and other Linear Frame haters.</em></p>\n<p><strong>Grafted Muscle and Bone Lace Cyberware Enhancement.</strong> The Grafted Muscle and Bone Lace now counts as Borgware for Max Humanity Loss. The user’s BODY is considered 1 higher for the purposes of determining Brawling/Martial Arts damage and satisfying BODY requirements for weapons or items (e.g., if a weapon may be wielded in one hand). Does not stack with the Primary Effect of Ol’ Donkey. If the user has at least two installations of Endo-Lace Bracing, their BODY is also considered 3 higher for the purposes of BODY Checks made to move, lift, or otherwise physically manipulate heavy objects.</p>\n<p><strong>Enhances:</strong> Grafted Muscle and Bone Lace<br>\n<strong>Option Slots:</strong> 0 (Cyberware Enhancement)</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Cyberware &gt; Internal Body Cyberware).</em></p>"
